        "faq_Hn9zAF": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I schedule a Yaz & Co. diamond ring consultation?",
            "answer": "<p>If you are interested in discovering the world of YAZ &<br/>Co. diamonds, we invite you to schedule a private consultation with our team. A<br/>YAZ & Co. specialist will guide you through our collections, answer your<br/>questions, and assist you in selecting a piece that reflects your story and<br/>style.</p><p>Private consultations are available online or by appointment<br/>in Abu Dhabi. To request your consultation, please contact us through our<br/>official channels or appointment request page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_RWnqW6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I care for my diamond jewelry?",
            "answer": "<p>Daily wear, natural oils, and environmental exposure may<br/>affect the brilliance of fine jewelry over time. To preserve the beauty of your<br/>YAZ & Co. piece, we recommend gentle regular care and thoughtful storage.</p><p>Clean your jewelry using a soft cloth and a non-abrasive<br/>jewelry cleaner suitable for fine jewelry. When not being worn, pieces should<br/>be stored individually in their original YAZ & Co. packaging to help<br/>protect their finish and brilliance.</p><p>For additional maintenance or inspection services, the YAZ<br/>& Co. team may assist upon request and evaluation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_cngbL4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the YAZ & Co. Authenticator & Warranty?",
            "answer": "<p>Each YAZ & Co. piece is accompanied by an official YAZ<br/>& Co. Authenticator containing the stone’s details and a unique serial<br/>number. Selected pieces may also be accompanied by an IGI certificate upon<br/>request for an additional fee.</p><p>All YAZ & Co. creations are covered by a one-year<br/>warranty against manufacturing defects. The warranty does not cover accidental<br/>damage, misuse, normal wear, loss of stones, or repairs carried out by third<br/>parties.</p><p>The YAZ & Co. Authenticator and Warranty are designed to<br/>offer assurance, transparency, and confidence with every creation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_hGHFxk": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When buying a diamond engagement ring, how do I determine a budget?",
            "answer": "<p>Choosing an engagement ring is a personal decision shaped by<br/>your preferences, lifestyle, and the meaning behind the piece. At YAZ &<br/>Co., we believe luxury should feel thoughtful and personal rather than defined<br/>by excess.</p><p>When determining your budget, consider the design, diamond<br/>shape, carat weight, craftsmanship, and overall balance of the piece. Our team<br/>is available to guide you through the process and help you select a ring that<br/>reflects both your vision and your story.</p>"
          }
        },
